1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:01,940
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) What if you woke up and the whole

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,520
world became Roblox?

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:07,620
Seven days, one game, and by day seven,

4
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:10,220
the world had 60 seconds left.

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:15,500
Okay, okay, I can explain.

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,260
It all started with a pop-up.

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,880
Last night, 2 a.m., a weird window

8
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:23,980
pops up on your tablet.

9
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,200
Turn the world into Roblox?

10
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:28,500
Yes or yes.

11
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,000
Sure, whatever.

12
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,340
You pressed yes.

13
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,160
Day one, your alarm doesn't ring.

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,320
It goes, daily reward claimed.

15
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,040
You look at your hands.

16
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,060
They're blocks.

17
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:44,840
Your bed?

18
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:45,580
Plastic.

19
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:46,500
Your floor?

20
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,640
Covered in tiny little studs.

21
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,580
Why is there a name tag floating over

22
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:52,340
my head?

23
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,540
You grab your toothbrush, and it goes into

24
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:56,960
slot one of your hotbar.

25
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:57,740
Equipped.

26
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:59,680
You don't walk down the stairs.

27
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,500
You jump all of them and lose half

28
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,080
your health.

29
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,660
Breakfast is ready, sweetie.

30
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:08,340
Mom's words pop up in a chat bubble

31
00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:10,960
over her head, and breakfast is a pancake

32
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,600
you have to click to eat.

33
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:16,420
Mmm, tastes like plastic.

34
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:19,720
Outside, the sun is a perfect square.

35
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:23,000
The clouds are blocks, and every tree is

36
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,260
the exact same tree.

37
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:25,880
And Dad?

38
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:28,720
Dad's been walking into the same wall for

39
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,840
45 minutes.

40
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:30,960
I'm fine.

41
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:33,140
I'm just going to the car.

42
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,820
Day two, you figure out the rules.

43
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:40,220
Rule one, you can jump five times higher

44
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:40,820
than before.

45
00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:43,460
So you jump onto the roof, then the

46
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,400
neighbor's roof, then a passing bird.

47
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:48,480
The whole neighborhood turns into one giant obby!

48
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:53,320
Rule two, anything glowing red is lava, including

49
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,240
the neighbor's hot tub.

50
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:54,960
Ahh!

51
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:59,600
Rule three, when you die, you just respawn.

52
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:02,180
In your bed, with a sparkly force field.

53
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,300
I'm immortal!

54
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:07,199
Stop respawning on my clean sheets!

55
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:10,700
Rule four, never stand still for too long.

56
00:02:11,180 --> 00:02:13,040
Dad sat on the couch for 20 minutes.

57
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,640
You have been disconnected.

58
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:17,540
Reason, idle for 20 minutes.

59
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:20,720
He loads back in an hour later.

60
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,120
One block at a time.

61
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,140
Feet first.

62
00:02:23,140 --> 00:02:24,520
Did I miss anything?

63
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,500
Day three, school.

64
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:30,060
The bus doesn't come, you spawn it.

65
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:32,360
Your teacher is an NPC now.

66
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:34,020
She can only say one thing.

67
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,620
Hello, would you like to start the quest?

68
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:38,940
Uh, no?

69
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,800
Hello, would you like to start the quest?

70
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,500
The math test?

71
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:44,500
It's an obby!

72
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:47,500
Every right answer is a platform, and every

73
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:49,200
wrong answer is a trapdoor.

74
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,020
Easy!

75
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:52,860
Seven times eight is 52!

76
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,240
Back to the start of the test.

77
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,260
Gym class!

78
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:58,880
First one to the top of the climbing

79
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,000
rope wins a badge!

80
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,860
I got a badge!

81
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,400
Welcome to school!

82
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:05,200
Everybody got that badge.

83
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:06,900
You get it for showing up.

84
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:09,860
And when the class bully tries to grab

85
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:11,720
your lunch, a pop-up appears.

86
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:13,540
You do not own this item.

87
00:03:14,260 --> 00:03:16,300
Sorry, game pass only.

88
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:19,980
Day four, money is gone!

89
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,880
Every dollar in the world turned into Robux!

90
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,220
Your piggy bank?

91
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,520
12 Robux.

92
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:28,020
You're officially the poorest kid on the block.

93
00:03:28,620 --> 00:03:30,760
The ice cream truck sells game passes now!

94
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,960
Double scoop, 99 Robux.

95
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:34,000
Infinite sprinkles?

96
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:34,940
400.

97
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,160
800 Robux?!

98
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,960
For a tank of gas?!

99
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,240
Dad checks his wallet.

100
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,760
Zero Robux.

101
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:44,420
He's been a free player his whole life.

102
00:03:45,050 --> 00:03:46,820
So you open a lemonade stand!

103
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:49,200
Five Robux a cup, and you're very first

104
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:49,640
customer.

105
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:53,740
Wait, you'll pay me double if I give

106
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,060
you the lemonade first?

107
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:56,940
Rule one of Roblox.

108
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:59,040
Never trust a guy who says that.

109
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,140
Ooh, new hair!

110
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:01,880
Buy!

111
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,820
Mom buys one hair from the catalog, and

112
00:04:04,820 --> 00:04:06,180
it just appears on her head.

113
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,040
Then another.

114
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:07,940
Then another.

115
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:11,400
By lunch, she's wearing 40 hats at once!

116
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,780
Mom, you can't even fit through the door.

117
00:04:15,540 --> 00:04:17,220
Fashion is pain, sweetie.

118
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:21,120
Oh, and everyone who subscribes gets a golden

119
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,320
name tag in the new world.

120
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,460
Everyone will know you're a legend.

121
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,680
Everyone who doesn't?

122
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:29,200
Default noob avatar forever.

123
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:33,900
Day five, something is wrong.

124
00:04:34,780 --> 00:04:36,100
Birds freeze in midair.

125
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,900
Cars stutter down the street.

126
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,400
The neighbor's dog runs.

127
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,360
Backwards.

128
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,320
Is the whole world lagging?

129
00:04:44,020 --> 00:04:45,880
A giant number appears in the sky.

130
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:46,580
Ping!

131
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:47,920
Nine thousand.

132
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:51,060
You throw a ball, it vanishes and lands

133
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:53,160
three seconds later on dad's head!

134
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:54,460
Ow.

135
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,220
Delayed ow.

136
00:04:57,980 --> 00:05:01,900
Sweetie, dinner is ready.

137
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,460
Then dad gets stuck in a T-pose

138
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:07,940
in the middle of the living room for

139
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:08,980
six hours.

140
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:10,120
I'm fine.

141
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:11,640
Everything is fine.

142
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:14,260
I just can't put my arms down.

143
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:18,220
Day six, you finally see it.

144
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:21,860
A giant mouse cursor floating in the sky!

145
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:25,000
It grabs your school and drags it across

146
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:25,380
town.

147
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,760
It clicks on a tree, and the tree

148
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,500
is deleted.

149
00:05:29,340 --> 00:05:33,300
Wait, this whole world is somebody's game.

150
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:37,220
And somewhere out there, the owner is editing

151
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:37,560
it.

152
00:05:38,180 --> 00:05:39,980
The cursor floats over your house.

153
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:41,380
You hold your breath.

154
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:44,500
It changes your roof to pink.

155
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:48,080
It drops a giant water slide into the

156
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:50,180
park, but forgets to anchor it.

157
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:52,860
The whole thing tips over, right onto the

158
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:53,120
mall.

159
00:05:53,820 --> 00:05:55,500
Then it copies the ice cream truck!

160
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:57,460
Paste, paste, paste!

161
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,220
A thousand ice cream trucks!

162
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:00,980
Free ice cream?

163
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,300
Still 99 robux.

164
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:09,700
Day seven, attention, this server is shutting down

165
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:10,520
for an update.

166
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,360
The sky turns red!

167
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:14,540
A countdown appears over the whole city!

168
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:15,820
60 seconds!

169
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,920
What happens when it hits zero?

170
00:06:18,540 --> 00:06:23,040
When a server shuts down, everybody inside disappears.

171
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:25,580
The whole town spams the chat.

172
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:26,320
Help!

173
00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:27,100
No!

174
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,340
What do we do?

175
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:31,620
Then you remember, the pop-up, the one

176
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:32,920
that started all of this.

177
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:35,580
If it has a yes, it has to

178
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:36,220
have a no.

179
00:06:36,940 --> 00:06:38,400
But the menu button is all the way

180
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,320
at the top of the sky.

181
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:41,020
Nobody can jump that high.

182
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,360
So the whole town lines up.

183
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:46,080
Mom in all 40 hats, the kid from

184
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,860
the lemonade stand, even the bully.

185
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:50,320
They stack up, one on top of the

186
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:52,840
other, into a giant tower of players.

187
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:55,000
Okay, here goes.

188
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,320
You jump!

189
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:59,920
Roof, bird, mom's hats, and dad, still in

190
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,500
his T-pose.

191
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:01,980
The perfect platform.

192
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,300
I knew this would come in handy!

193
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,900
30 seconds.

194
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:10,420
Cloud, cloud, cloud, all the way to the

195
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:12,620
top of the sky, where the menu button

196
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:12,980
lives.

197
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:16,460
10 seconds, the cursor reaches for a shutdown.

198
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,920
Wait, please, don't delete us!

199
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:22,960
The cursor stops.

200
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:25,000
Update complete.

201
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,720
Turn the world back to normal.

202
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,260
Yes, yes, yes!

203
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:33,040
And just like that, grass is grass.

204
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,920
Plastic is not plastic.

205
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,640
Mom has one hat again.

206
00:07:37,060 --> 00:07:38,140
Dad can put his arms down.

207
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:40,940
And I finally made it to the car!

208
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:43,160
Everything was back to normal.

209
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,820
Almost.

210
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:47,120
Breakfast, sweetie!

211
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:50,280
Mom's words still pop up in a chat

212
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:50,580
bubble.

213
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,700
Comment oof if you'd turn the world into

214
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:55,260
Roblox.

215
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:56,720
Update failed.

216
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:59,180
Rolling back to day one.

217
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,580
No, no, no!

218
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,920
Not day one!
